units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p m
atom_style atomic
run_style verlet
lattice bcc 3.3 orient x 1 0 0 orient y 0 1 0 orient z 0 0 1
region whole block 0 66 0 66 -1.65 211.35 units box
create_box 1 whole
region projectile block 0 19.999999 0 19.999999 0 19.999999 units lattice
region target0 block 0 19.999999 0 19.999999 20 59.999999 units lattice
create_atoms 1 region projectile
create_atoms 1 region target0
group projectile region projectile
group target region target0
pair_style eam/fs
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
mass 1 92.90638
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep 0.001
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step time temp pe ke etotal
thermo_modify flush yes
velocity all create 300 4928459 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
reset_timestep 0
fix eq all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
run 100000
reset_timestep 0
velocity projectile set NULL NULL 20 sum yes units box
fix prod all nve
run 100000
